flowchart TD
    A([Start / Power On]) --> B[Receive child's voice command]
    B --> C[Speech Processing Algorithm<br/>• Wake word / push-to-talk<br/>• Noise reduction<br/>• ASR + confidence scoring<br/>• Intent + parameters]
    C --> D{Speech recognized<br/>with sufficient confidence?}
    D -- No --> B2[Request repeat / provide feedback<br/>Try again] --> B
    D -- Yes --> E[Bucketing Algorithm<br/>Choose path / scenario bucket<br/>based on intent + therapy rules]

    %% --- MAIN CONTROL LOOP ---
    E --> L{{Main Control Loop<br/>repeat until all cars reach assigned points}}

    %% --- CURRENT LOCATION ---
    L --> F[Current Location Algorithm<br/>• Estimate inter-car distances<br/>• Infer relative positions<br/>• Fuse into shared pose estimates]
    F --> G[Assign target points<br/>Based on chosen path + current locations<br/>• Each car gets 1 point]

    %% --- CAMERA / MAP UPDATE ---
    G --> H[Camera Input Algorithm per car<br/>• Capture frames<br/>• Obstacle detection]
    H --> I[Classify obstacles<br/>Moving vs Unmoving]
    I --> J[Update Shared Map network<br/>• Merge observations<br/>• De-duplicate: same obstacle profile if seen by multiple cars<br/>• Broadcast map to all cars]

    %% --- MOVEMENT ---
    J --> K[Movement Algorithm per car<br/>• Plan path to assigned point]
    K --> K2{Path obstructed?}
    K2 -- No --> M[Estimate motor trajectory] --> N[Execute movement along path]
    K2 -- Yes --> OA[Obstacle Algorithm]

    %% --- OBSTACLE ALGORITHM DETAILS ---
    subgraph OA_SUB[Obstacle Algorithm per car]
        OA --> O1{Obstacle marked moving?}
        O1 -- Yes --> O2{Waited 2 cycles yet?}
        O2 -- No --> O3[Wait until next Current Location cycle]
        O2 -- Yes --> O4[Repath to avoid obstacle]
        O1 -- No --> O4
        O4 --> O5{Repath still blocked?}
        O5 -- Yes --> O6[Replace target point<br/>with nearest unobstructed point]
        O5 -- No --> O7[Proceed with new path]
        O6 --> O7
    end

    O7 --> M

    %% --- LOOP CONDITIONS ---
    N --> P{All cars reached<br/>their assigned points?}
    P -- No --> L
    P -- Yes --> Q[Provide feedback to child<br/>Celebrate success!]
    Q --> A